# Xojo (formerly REALbasic and Real Studio)

Builds*
*.debug
*.debug.app
Debug*.exe
Debug*/Debug*.exe
Debug*/Debug*\ Libs
*.rbuistate
*.xojo_uistate
*.obsolete

# Release artefacts. These are built by .github/workflows/release.yml and
# attached to the GitHub release; they have no business in the repository.
/dist/

# Go build output (the engine now lives at the root)
/crossbreeder-plus
/crossbreeder-plus.exe
/crossbreeder-plus-*

# Windows resources are generated per build from versioninfo.json, so that the
# version they carry matches the tag rather than whenever they were last
# committed. Keeping them untracked also keeps the working tree clean at build
# time, which is what lets the binaries report vcs.modified=false.
*.syso
versioninfo.build.json
